  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Only brick house in the neighborhood. This unique beautifully kept, family oriented, world travelers' 30A home is available to you. Easy walk/drive to a variety of beaches and assorted destinations (Easy stroll to Stinky's Restaurant). Fenced back yard, barbecue/casual dining area at pool side. Balcony sundeck. Step inside Europa and feel wrapped in tranquility and privacy: stunning, mirrored wet bar, soaring ceilings, all surfaces granite or marble, kitchen fit for the true chef, awesome lighting, floating staircase, delightful accessories from all over the globe. All furnishings are upscale - many custom made for this home. Powder room, sunroom and sofa sleepers are located on ground floor. King bed in downstairs master, jetted tub in the adjoining, slightly elevated bath - as well as a separate, oversized shower. Full accommodations in three bedrooms include two kings and one set of twin beds in a mini-suite. All are equipped with top of the line mattresses/linens. TVs included. HBO. WiFi. Well-behaved, flea-free DOGS with responsible parents are welcome. Honeymoon and Anniversary Perfect. Stay where Athletes/Celebrities stay...GO STEELERS! YAY RAVENS! GO FALCONS! BRAVO BRAVES! PETS - DOGS welcome, maximum 2 pets allowed. Leash to be used off property and, please, clean up after pets regardless of location. Minimum Stay 3 nights.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
